# FLOOR 8: THE MERCHANT'S CROSSING
*"Five days. One stall. The market doesn't care who you are — only what you're selling."*

*Complete document — all systems (map, economy cap, gathering, robbery, guards, Guild, Church, Graveyards, Slums, the Road, Syndicate Grudge) are merged directly into the text below. This is the whole floor, run-ready.*

